{"schemaVersion":1,"id":26,"sections":[{"id":"112001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[850],"start":0,"count":12},{"id":"112001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10840],"start":12,"count":8},{"id":"112002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[860],"start":20,"count":21},{"id":"112002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10850],"start":41,"count":11},{"id":"112003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[870],"start":52,"count":9},{"id":"112003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10860],"start":61,"count":11}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:2","scriptId":850,"text":"双方的阵地被分配在南北两侧，中间非常广阔的平原就是本次的战场。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:3","scriptId":850,"text":"场地中的战车兽已经被清理干净，因此不必担心会突遇战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:4","scriptId":850,"text":"我方阵地的临时指挥部----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:5","scriptId":850,"text":"“第一场夺旗的位置对我们比较有利，旗帜摆放的位置更偏向我们的阵地。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:6","scriptId":850,"text":"“那么就由我去把旗帜带回来吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":87,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:7","scriptId":850,"text":"“恩，莉娜速度快，应该能比桑赫斯特率先到达，这样就可以避免交锋白赚一局。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":87,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:8","scriptId":850,"text":"“那就由我去援护莉娜。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":31,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:9","scriptId":850,"text":"“莉娜以最快速度去夺旗这个没有问题，但是佐伊不能去援护，换成奈乐。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":31,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:10","scriptId":850,"text":"“诶！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:11","scriptId":850,"text":"“除莉娜和奈乐以外的所有人，都参与到物资收集中，尽量避免正面交火。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:12","scriptId":850,"text":"“就是说第一场主要任务是收集物资？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":163,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-PROLOGUE:850:13","scriptId":850,"text":"“正是。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":163,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112001-EPILOGUE:10840:1","scriptId":10840,"text":"比赛正式打响，除莉娜以外其他人分成两队开始向空投的物资进发。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":163,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112001-EPILOGUE:10840:2","scriptId":10840,"text":"而莉娜以最快速度到达了旗帜处，不过事情果然不会那么简单的结束，桑赫斯特的安娜也已经赶到。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":163,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":88,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-EPILOGUE:10840:3","scriptId":10840,"text":"“什么！？竟然那么快就到了？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":163,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-EPILOGUE:10840:4","scriptId":10840,"text":"“我劝你还是乖乖把旗帜交出来，正面和我交战你是没有胜算的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":295,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":88,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-EPILOGUE:10840:5","scriptId":10840,"text":"“想都别想！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":295,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112001-EPILOGUE:10840:6","scriptId":10840,"text":"莉娜扛起旗帜转身就跑……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":295,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112001-EPILOGUE:10840:7","scriptId":10840,"text":"“唉，真是不明白实力之间的差距啊，和我比赛跑真是愚蠢～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":295,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112001-EPILOGUE:10840:8","scriptId":10840,"text":"安娜摇了摇头，开始追击莉娜。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":295,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:2","scriptId":860,"text":"在速度方面安娜占有非常大的优势，眼看就要追上莉娜了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:5","scriptId":860,"text":"一颗炮弹从正面飞了过来，安娜一个侧滑闪开了，顺势躲到了一块岩石背后。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:6","scriptId":860,"text":"“哦呀，果然是有埋伏吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:7","scriptId":860,"text":"“切，没打中。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:8","scriptId":860,"text":"“哼哼，情况逆转了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":87,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:9","scriptId":860,"text":"又是一阵猛烈的炮击，奈乐完全压制住了安娜，根本不让她从那块岩石后面出来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":87,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:10","scriptId":860,"text":"“不错，不错，如果不这样真是会很无聊的呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:13","scriptId":860,"text":"突然从另一个方向飞来一发炮弹，正中奈乐的炮盾，但由于角度不好，炮弹被弹开了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":113,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:14","scriptId":860,"text":"“援军吗！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":113,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:15","scriptId":860,"text":"奈乐查看了一下炮盾，被确确实实得打出了一个凹痕。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":113,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":296,"speaker":"芬妮·朱安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:16","scriptId":860,"text":"“终于赶上了，安娜没事吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":113,"right":296,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:17","scriptId":860,"text":"芬妮的到来立刻让局势再次发生了逆转，这时无线电中听到指挥官的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":113,"right":296,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:19","scriptId":860,"text":"“奈乐后撤！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":108,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:20","scriptId":860,"text":"“可是这样的话，旗帜怎么办----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":108,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:21","scriptId":860,"text":"“没关系的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:22","scriptId":860,"text":"“嘿！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":81,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:23","scriptId":860,"text":"只见莉娜像投标枪一样，把旗帜往反方向投掷了出去。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":81,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:24","scriptId":860,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":81,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:25","scriptId":860,"text":"旗帜划过长空，飞向了远方。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":81,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:26","scriptId":860,"text":"“算你们聪明，芬妮，我们追！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-PROLOGUE:860:27","scriptId":860,"text":"说完安娜和芬妮转身向着旗帜的方向追去，只留下奈乐呆呆地站在原地。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":295,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:1","scriptId":10850,"text":"由于把得来的旗帜拱手送人，桑赫斯特轻松获得了第一场夺旗战的胜利。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":295,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:2","scriptId":10850,"text":"桑赫斯特临时指挥部----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":295,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:3","scriptId":10850,"text":"“芬妮和安娜，你们干得很好，让我们桑赫斯特拔得头筹。当然这也是必然结果。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":752,"right":295,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:4","scriptId":10850,"text":"“小意思～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":752,"right":295,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":262,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:5","scriptId":10850,"text":"“但是收集物资方面伏龙芝是领先了，没想到她们剩下的人是在全力收集物资。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":262,"right":295,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:6","scriptId":10850,"text":"“好在塞姬收集到了一箱物资。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":262,"right":271,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":262,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:7","scriptId":10850,"text":"“物资有点落后，早知道我和利薇尔就不在后面埋伏了，对面压根就没想着进攻。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":262,"right":271,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":298,"speaker":"塞姬·艾恩赛德","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:8","scriptId":10850,"text":"“哈哈，碰巧那个物资箱就落在我的附近嘛，太容易了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":262,"right":298,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":758,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:9","scriptId":10850,"text":"“不要紧，这点小事并不能动摇我们的胜利，物资落后的话，那就速战速决。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":758,"right":298,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:10","scriptId":10850,"text":"“说的对，我们速战速决就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":758,"right":271,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":259,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112002-EPILOGUE:10850:11","scriptId":10850,"text":"“对，正面战斗她们根本不堪一击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":259,"right":271,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:0","scriptId":870,"text":"观测席的索菲亚教官都要气得跳起来了……看来伊莎贝尔教官没有忘记抓住机会冷嘲热讽一番。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":259,"right":271,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:2","scriptId":870,"text":"“呵呵呵呵～果然和我预测的一样，第一场毫无悬念的胜利啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":291,"right":271,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:3","scriptId":870,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":291,"right":216,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:4","scriptId":870,"text":"“不过真没想到竟然会是自己拱手将旗帜扔出去，真是让我大开眼界啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":291,"right":216,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:5","scriptId":870,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":291,"right":216,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:6","scriptId":870,"text":"“虽然伏龙芝是败了一场，但收集到了不少物资，从结果上来看并没有失利多少。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":223,"right":216,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:7","scriptId":870,"text":"“恩，这都是为后面的战斗做铺垫。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":223,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:8","scriptId":870,"text":"“愚蠢，和我们桑赫斯特打消耗战？想法不错，但实力上还差得远呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":291,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-PROLOGUE:870:9","scriptId":870,"text":"“哼，现在就随你说吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":291,"right":216,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:2","scriptId":10860,"text":"伏龙芝临时指挥部----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":291,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:3","scriptId":10860,"text":"“大家做得很好，虽然第一场夺旗战失利了，但是大部分的物资都落到了我们手里，对剩下几场战斗非常有帮助。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:4","scriptId":10860,"text":"“难道是故意输的吗？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:5","scriptId":10860,"text":"“可以这么认为，第一场战斗中不宜消耗过大，而且没有物资的支持，更加不能轻举妄动。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:6","scriptId":10860,"text":"“那么接下来的战斗就可以放手一战了吧，反正物资到手了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:7","scriptId":10860,"text":"“恩，下一场夺旗战，因为没有空投物资了，双方一定会进行激烈的正面对抗。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:8","scriptId":10860,"text":"“于是，我们的目标很明确，守旗。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:9","scriptId":10860,"text":"“什么是守旗？不是夺旗吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":350,"speaker":"茜罗娅·约德尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:10","scriptId":10860,"text":"“我想我明白了，就是说下一场战斗，我们主要就是消耗敌人，而并不是以夺旗为目标。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":350,"right":41,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":165,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:11","scriptId":10860,"text":"“简单来说就是别想着夺旗，就只管往死里打～因为补给充足～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":350,"right":165,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112003-EPILOGUE:10860:12","scriptId":10860,"text":"“没错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":165,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["正式开始军演，第一场夺旗赛开始。","果然对面的安娜速度比想象中的还快，看来只能放弃了。","一切都在可预料的范围内。"]}
